          "failure": "The creature is frightened|CRB|frightened 2.",
          "criticalFailure": "The creature is frightened|CRB|frightened 3 and fleeing. If a creature is already frightened when it fails a save against Dooming Bark, its frightened value increases by 1 and it becomes doomed|CRB|doomed 1. A creature in an area that the cu sith can't easily reach—such as a hidden burrow or enclosed building—increases the degree of success of its saving throw against Dooming Bark by one step."
